"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m039-0186","start":186,"end":189,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000235","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m039-0204","start":204,"end":206,"surface":"夷吾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000379","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m039-0213","start":213,"end":215,"surface":"隰朋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000244","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m039-0219","start":219,"end":221,"surface":"夷吾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000379","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m039-0224","start":224,"end":226,"surface":"晉君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000379","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m039-0229","start":229,"end":231,"surface":"惠公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000379","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m039-0232","start":232,"end":235,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000235","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p052","text":"狄伐咎如，得二女：以長女妻重耳，生伯鯈、叔劉；以少女妻趙衰，生盾。居狄五歳而晉獻公卒，裏克已殺奚齊、悼子，乃使人迎，欲立重耳。重耳畏殺，因固謝，不敢入。已而晉更迎其弟夷吾立之，是爲惠公。惠公七年，畏重耳，乃使宦者履鞮與壯士欲殺重耳。重耳聞之，乃謀趙衰等曰：「始吾奔狄，非以爲可用與，以近易通，故且休足。休足久矣，固願徙之大國。夫齊桓公好善，志在霸王，收恤諸侯。今聞管仲、隰朋死，此亦欲得賢佐，盍往乎？」於是遂行。重耳謂其妻曰：「待我二十五年不來，乃嫁。」其妻笑曰：「犁二十五年，吾冢上柏大矣。雖然，妾待子。」重耳居狄凡十二年而去。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"長女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001744","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"伯鯈","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001745","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"叔劉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001746","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"少女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001747","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"趙衰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000329","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0038","start":38,"end":41,"surface":"晉獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000374","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"裏克","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000381","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"奚齊","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"悼子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000383","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"夷吾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000379","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"惠公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000379","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"惠公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000379","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0099","start":99,"end":101,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"履鞮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001718","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0116","start":116,"end":118,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0123","start":123,"end":125,"surface":"趙衰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000329","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0164","start":164,"end":167,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000235","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0182","start":182,"end":184,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000243","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0185","start":185,"end":187,"surface":"隰朋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000244","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0206","start":206,"end":208,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0209","start":209,"end":211,"surface":"其妻","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001744","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0227","start":227,"end":229,"surface":"其妻","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001744","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m052-0254","start":254,"end":256,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p040","text":"初，子比自晉歸，韓宣子問叔向曰：「子比其濟乎？」對曰：「不就。」宣子曰：「同惡相求，如市賈焉，何爲不就？」對曰：「無與同好，誰與同惡？取國有五難：有寵無人，一也；有人無主，二也；有主無謀，三也；有謀而無民，四也；有民而無德，五也。子比在晉十三年矣，晉、楚之從不聞通者，可謂無人矣；族盡親叛，可謂無主矣；無釁而動，可謂無謀矣；爲羈終世，可謂無民矣；亡無愛徴，可謂無德矣。王虐而不忌，子比渉五難以弒君，誰能濟之！有楚國者，其棄疾乎？君陳、蔡，方城外屬焉。苛慝不作，盜賊伏隱，私欲不違，民無怨心。先神命之，國民信之。羋姓有亂，必季實立，楚之常也。子比之官，則右尹也；數其貴寵，則庶子也；以神所命，則又遠之；民無懷焉，將何以立？」宣子曰：「齊桓、晉文不亦是乎？」對曰：「齊桓，衞姬之子也，有寵於釐公。有鮑叔牙、賓須無、隰朋以爲輔，有莒、衞以爲外主，有髙、國以爲内主。從善如流，施惠不倦。有國，不亦宜乎？昔我文公，狐季姬之子也，有寵於獻公。好學不倦。生十七年，有士五人，有先大夫子餘、子犯以爲腹心，有魏犫、賈佗以爲股肱，有齊、宋、秦、楚以爲外主，有欒、郤、狐、先以爲内主。亡十九年，守志彌篤。惠、懷棄民，民從而與之。故文公有國，不亦宜乎？子比無施於民，無援於外，去晉，晉不送；歸楚，楚不迎。何以有國！」子比果不終焉，卒立者棄疾，如叔向言也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"子比","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001890","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"韓宣子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002009","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"叔向","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002010","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"子比","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001890","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"宣子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002009","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"子比","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001890","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0184","start":184,"end":186,"surface":"王虐","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"叔向引語中的楚王稱，待核事件先後，先保留未定位置。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0190","start":190,"end":192,"surface":"子比","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001890","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0210","start":210,"end":212,"surface":"棄疾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001892","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0270","start":270,"end":272,"surface":"子比","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001890","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0311